#: scenario:scenario_2AFF8341_4A3E_430F_A1D6_31F2D481EF83
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6268a625e4935745c183699c4ddaa9794cdd1a83ad7a638ba8ff35abe87c613e
#. default-sha256: 00329079da43560bef30b4ffad8822fda731c19e8522580b7dc30520fdd28849
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_2AFF8341_4A3E_430F_A1D6_31F2D481EF83"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫The crestfallen young man faded into the distance, and the decrepit double doors "
"clacked shut."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫打ちひしがれる青年が遠ざかり、⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫「⟪k:4⟫あなた⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫死者⟪k:7⟫」の目の前で、"
"⟪k:8⟫硝子を失った扉が閉まる。"

#: scenario:scenario_43A49B46_7AAD_44A2_B999_45334FEA1E47
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0e40d63e990a434b1890a1a20b37d52a584c3f9aa803e157e106db9c42bb3b75
#. default-sha256: 9148f279d5ad286b9bd35e2c80ec7c3510c56cb01f80e4fddb44f81015f29cca
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_43A49B46_7AAD_44A2_B999_45334FEA1E47"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Through the shattered glass, ⟪k:1⟫You⟪k:2⟫the Departed⟪k:3⟫ could see only the ruins of a "
"garden, not a single rose growing within. ⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫You⟪k:6⟫He⟪k:7⟫ had evidently returned from "
"the past."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫扉の向こう側を見ても、⟪k:1⟫薔薇の一つも見つからない荒廃した庭が広がるばかりだ。⟪k:2⟫「⟪k:3⟫あ"
"なた⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫死者⟪k:6⟫」はいつの間にか、⟪k:7⟫元の世界に戻っていた。"

#: scenario:scenario_0FB3F01D_B617_4D13_8095_F4F8541039DF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 05b023ce2e651e6761482a9984ac9194561dfa1252cbb6a8cd918b85c3ee7518
#. default-sha256: e25579f59c05dfbd7396d1ba24f416bffc64b2d37eebc9426ef04ad0da9afb7e
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_0FB3F01D_B617_4D13_8095_F4F8541039DF"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫In the garden, weeds grew taller than people. ⟪k:1⟫You⟪k:2⟫He⟪k:3⟫ found it difficult to "
"look at. ⟪k:4⟫A wolf howled in the distance."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫扉の向こうに見える庭は、⟪k:1⟫おい茂る雑草が人の背丈を軽く越えており、⟪k:2⟫見るも無残なもの"
"だ。⟪k:3⟫遠くで狼の遠吠えも聞こえる。"

#: scenario:scenario_93B40010_CB1F_4857_8A6C_0EE53963A89B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 968b131bd186cfcea833c803be30d69c69646832c575a6ac469e6a0ce490c04f
#. default-sha256: b48c0789a189722eaa4d161492a17ac0ff5895b486a1f981aa9a9f719c5c02be
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_93B40010_CB1F_4857_8A6C_0EE53963A89B"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The children, the sea of roses, and the White-Haired Girl were nowhere to be found."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫子供の姿も、⟪k:1⟫美しく咲き乱れる薔薇園も、⟪k:2⟫白い髪の娘も居ない。"

#: scenario:scenario_86CD0575_B690_4CCE_B840_8CAD4CBE8F1B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1be9cd22b3438d4f6084b5c843f3fe54e68bcbc301190c99f563880f37042851
