#: scenario:scenario_23DC6B01_83EC_42FB_8E1C_A0D23A5383B2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6a04984af0362ae405fc64d30e8fb524a1506b5f735fd174c9efd06638f989d8
